<title>USA: Pegasus Gold names Michael Clark COO.</title>
<headline>Pegasus Gold names Michael Clark COO.</headline>
<dateline>HEMET, Calif. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pegasus Gold Inc said it named Michael Clark senior vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>It said Clark was previously employed with Pegasus for five years in the late 1980s and early 1990s, when he also served as executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to say where Clark was employed in the interim, or whom he was succeeding.</p>
